@startuml
actor User
participant "微信小程序端" as App
participant "Spring Boot服务端" as Server
database MySQL
User -> App: 提交评论请求
activate App
App -> Server: 提交评论请求
activate Server
Server -> Server: 设置当前时间
Server -> Server: 插入评论到数据库
Server -> Server: 获取订单信息
Server -> Server: 更新订单状态为已完成
alt 更新成功
    Server -> Server: 获取用户评论信息
    Server -> Server: 获取骑手评论信息
    Server -> Server: 更新缓存信息
    Server --> App: 返回评论成功消息
else 更新失败
    Server --> App: 返回评论失败消息
end
deactivate Server
deactivate App
@enduml
